Initial CTA: the empty workspace's composer, handed over to the dock on first send.
See specs/initial-cta.md. Geometry comes from [InitialCtaLayout], shared with all four frameworks.

@param started False shows the invitation; true shows the conversation with the composer docked.
@param fold A fold in this view's coordinates. When null and [detectFold] is true, it is read
