        name: "Release notes voice", description: "One line per change, the benefit first, plain verbs, no marketing words.",
        instructions: "Write one short line per change. Start each line with New, Faster, Fixed or Next month. Lead with what the reader can now do. Use plain verbs; avoid marketing words and exclamation marks.")

